{"caption":"","data":"FSC.thresholdHessian_apply {n : ℕ} (G : FSC.Mat n) (hG : WeakSimplex.IsCorrelation G) (hDistinct : FSC.DistinctScores G)\n  (t : ℝ) (ht : 0 < t) (i j : Fin n) :\n  ((fderiv ℝ (FSC.thresholdGradient G) (WeakSimplex.Coord.ofFun fun x => t)) ((EuclideanSpace.basisFun (Fin n) ℝ) i))\n      ((EuclideanSpace.basisFun (Fin n) ℝ) j) =\n    FSC.stress G t i j -\n      if i = j then\n        t * (FSC.thresholdGradient G (WeakSimplex.Coord.ofFun fun x => t)) ((EuclideanSpace.basisFun (Fin n) ℝ) i)\n      else 0","endPos":{"column":6,"line":12},"fileName":"/tmp/fsc-source-reproduction-20260909T012906Z/checkout/FSCProbes/ThresholdExpansionAudit.lean","isSilent":false,"keepFullRange":false,"kind":"[anonymous]","pos":{"column":0,"line":12},"severity":"information"}
